      // Connector tool-resolution proofs await the naming health response before counting API calls.
      // Connector TLS fixtures forward over fresh upstream connections; each viewport releases
      // its new account links on failure so a transport error cannot contaminate the next viewport.
      // Release configuration rejects documented OAuth secret prefixes in client IDs before
